---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="hero" data-hero data-dark data-section="Start" aria-labelledby="hero-h">
  <div class="hero__media" data-hero-media>
    <canvas data-halftone aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="hero__shade"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero__inner grid">
    <h1 id="hero-h" class="hero__title" data-hero-title>
      Research<br />that holds up<br />in imperfect data
    </h1>
    <p class="hero__text justify" data-scramble-in>
      Exact pattern mining over uncertain data, and early-warning systems evaluated
      the way schools would actually use them. An academic journey from the Mekong
      to the Danube and back.
    </p>
    <div class="hero__cta" data-hero-fade>
      <a class="btn" href={`${base}#routes`}>Discover routes</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; height: 100svh; min-height: 34rem; overflow: hidden; color: #fff; background: var(--film-dark); }
  .hero__media { position: absolute; inset: 0; will-change: transform; }
  .hero__media :global(canvas) { position: absolute; inset: -4%; width: 108%; height: 108%; display: block; will-change: transform, opacity; }
  .hero__shade { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20, 16, 12, 0.35), rgba(20, 16, 12, 0.05) 40%, rgba(20, 16, 12, 0.55)); }
  .hero__inner { position: relative; height: 100%; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; padding-block: 7.5rem 4rem; }
  .hero__title { grid-column: 1 / span 8; grid-row: 1; font-size: var(--fs-h1); }
  .hero__text { grid-column: 9 / span 4; grid-row: 2; align-self: center; max-width: 30rem; }
  .hero__cta { grid-column: 1 / span 4; grid-row: 3; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero__title, .hero__text, .hero__cta { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .hero__text { align-self: end; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .hero__inner { padding-block: 6.5rem 2.5rem; }
  }
</style>
